# 💻 CLI Rules

- 🔌 Slash commands must be explicitly registered in `commands/registry.js`.
- ⚙️ Autocomplete, system menu, and `/help` must dynamically derive from the registry.
- 🛡️ Guard Enquirer/Ora spinners with `process.stdout.isTTY` to prevent CI/Docker crashes.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Post-Prompt Trigger**: After your prompt response is complete, ALWAYS review and update corresponding architecture documentation and tests.
